+# Async Runtime Policy
+
+This project has no recorded decision on an async runtime. A search of the repository's documentation and source (including `docs/doc.md`, `README.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, and other project docs) found no policy, ADR, or other recorded statement establishing or retiring an async runtime choice; the only related mentions are example handler code using goroutines, which does not constitute a recorded decision.
